      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The highest price is \\(17\\) and the lowest price is \\(10.\\) This means the percent is \\[ (\\dfrac{17}{10}-1)\\cdot 100 = 70.\\]\n\nThus, the answer is C .",
